========================================================================================================================
HPE VM ESSENTIALS (VME) 8.1.2 - PCS CLUSTER TROUBLESHOOTING & LOG ANALYSIS
========================================================================================================================

CATEGORY               COMMAND                                         DESCRIPTION
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
PCS Health Check       sudo pcs status --full                          Absolute overview of nodes, resources, & constraints
PCS Health Check       sudo pcs property show                          Display active global cluster attributes (e.g. stonith)
PCS Health Check       sudo pcs constraint show                        List all resource location, colocation, and order rules
PCS Health Check       sudo pcs cluster config show                    Verify active corosync node topologies & ring IDs

Node Remediation       sudo pcs cluster node delete <node_name>        Purge a stale/removed host entry from the configuration
Node Remediation       sudo pcs node clear <node_name>                 Clear fence/failure memory barriers on a specific node
Node Remediation       sudo pcs resource cleanup                       Global reset of resource history to clear error flags
Node Remediation       sudo pcs cluster auth                           Force node re-authentication across the private cluster
Node Remediation       sudo pcs cluster sync                           Push the working cluster layout definitions to all nodes

Live Log Tailing       tail -f /var/log/pacemaker/pacemaker.log        Monitor live DC election transitions and fence execution
Live Log Tailing       tail -f /var/log/corosync/corosync.log          Stream low-level heartbeat rings and node drops
Live Log Tailing       tail -f /var/log/messages | grep -E "pcs|gfs2"   Filter core OS logs for sudden cluster dropouts
Live Log Tailing       tail -f /var/log/morpheus/morpheus-ui/current   Monitor VME Manager sync and cluster heartbeat loops

Log Error Searching    grep -i "error" /var/log/pacemaker/pacemaker.log Filter pacemaker logs for explicit state failures
Log Error Searching    grep -i "fenc" /var/log/pacemaker/pacemaker.log  Search cluster history for triggered STONITH actions
Log Error Searching    grep -i "totem" /var/log/corosync/corosync.log   Check for token loss timeouts or heartbeat failures
Log Error Searching    journalctl -u corosync --no-pager -n 100         Review the last 100 systemd log lines for Corosync
Log Error Searching    journalctl -u pacemaker --no-pager -n 100        Review the last 100 systemd log lines for Pacemaker
